{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4662a23d-0fdd-89ca-a35a-09a189f53258",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T11:41:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paulo Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Is it all right if I ask something? I'm trying to reach a restaurant. Is this the, uh, the place on Thames Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, sir, this is the City Clerk at City Hall in Newport. Which restaurant were you trying to call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. So I dialed wrong. It's a seafood place, I'm supposed to put in a big order for the holiday. I have the number written down here on a receipt, it's just my handwriting is not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. Do you know the name of it? I can't look up a business for you from here, but you could search the name on your phone, or check the receipt for the full number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it all right if I read you what I dialed? Maybe you can tell me where I went wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I put four-oh-one, and then five-five-five, and the rest. But now I'm looking at the receipt and I think it says four-one-three, not four-oh-one. Is that a different area code? Is it all right if I ask where that is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-one-three isn't Rhode Island. That's western Massachusetts. Rhode Island is four-oh-one. So if the restaurant is here in Newport, it'd be four-oh-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. So then which one is right? I'm not sure now. The seven could be a one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you from here, I'm sorry. If the place is in Newport, I'd try four-oh-one first. If that doesn't connect, try the other. Or look the restaurant up online, the listing will have the right number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. That makes sense. I'll try four-oh-one with the digits again. I just thought, because my phone is from out of town originally, maybe I needed the different code."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:40:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your phone number's area code doesn't matter for local calls, you just dial the number you want. Usually you'd include the area code anyway on a cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Is it all right if I say one more thing? Sorry to take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gas dropped a few cents this morning at the station by me. Made my morning, honestly. Small thing, but I noticed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll take any good news before Christmas. Hopefully it holds."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Okay. So I will try the number again. Thank you for being patient with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. If you need anything from City Hall, we're here. Feliz Navidad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T11:41:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Merry Christmas to you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
